# Personal / local notes — not committed
# These patterns cover common names for scratch pads, design notes,
# and personal logs that should stay local. The negation rules below
# ensure .claude/ and .agents/ (shared agent skills & config) are
# always tracked regardless of any catch-all above.
NOTES.md
NOTES.txt
TODO.md
TODO.txt
SCRATCH.md
PERSONAL.md
BUILD_IN_PUBLIC.md
PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md
/notes/
/personal/
/scratch/
/local-docs/
/private/

# Keep agent config directories tracked even if a parent rule would catch them
!/.claude/
!/.agents/